# P2-02: written by the wheel-build step (CI or scripts/embed_build_commit.py)
# right before `python -m build` - a dev checkout must never carry this, or
# `_source_revision()`'s git fallback would be silently shadowed by a stale
# embedded commit instead of reading the real live checkout state.
optarena/_build_commit.txt

